===Verb===
{{en-verb}}

# {{lb|en|intransitive}} To [[write]] or [[speak]] after the manner of an epitaph.
#* {{quote-text|en|year=1606|author={{w|Joseph Hall (bishop)|Joseph Hall}}|title=Heaven upon Earth
|passage=The Commons in their speeches '''epitaph''' upon him {{...}} "He lived as a wolf and died as a dog."}}
# {{lb|en|transitive}} To [[commemorate]] by an epitaph.
#* {{quote-text|en|year=1592|author=w:Gabriel Harvey|title=Foure Letters and certaine Sonnets
|passage=Let me rather be '''epitaphed''' the inventor of the English Hexameter.}}

